{"id":340,"bangumiId":340,"type":2,"name":"蟲師","name_cn":"虫师","date":"2005-10-22","year":"2005","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/40/00/340_J14Mj.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/40/00/340_J14Mj.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/40/00/340_J14Mj.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/40/00/340_J14Mj.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/40/00/340_J14Mj.jpg"},"summary":"这里的虫既不是动植物，也与微生物和菌类不同，是更接近生命原生态的东西。这些东西总称为“虫”。它们的形态和存在都很暧昧，当人与虫的世界重叠之时，发生了超越人类智慧的怪异现象，此时人类才开始知道它们的存在。 \r\n所谓生命，并非为威胁异己而存在。只是，各自以各自的形态存在着——作为连接这样的”虫“与人类的”虫师“--主人公银古，在旅途中不断与各种各样的人及与其关联的虫相遇。绘就了每话登场人物各不相同，读不尽的画卷。","rating":{"rank":21,"total":12000,"count":{"1":20,"2":9,"3":10,"4":19,"5":93,"6":273,"7":1026,"8":3063,"9":4445,"10":3042},"score":8.7},"collection":{"on_hold":2325,"dropped":418,"wish":9865,"collect":16592,"doing":2847},"tags":[{"name":"治愈","count":3846,"total_count":309475},{"name":"虫师","count":2852,"total_count":4242},{"name":"奇幻","count":1761,"total_count":494743},{"name":"神音乐","count":1446,"total_count":1682},{"name":"空灵","count":1352,"total_count":1439},{"name":"内涵系","count":1330,"total_count":1751},{"name":"TV","count":1225,"total_count":1450662},{"name":"2005","count":1092,"total_count":23980},{"name":"治愈系","count":907,"total_count":25460},{"name":"人生","count":883,"total_count":12112},{"name":"水墨","count":561,"total_count":1373},{"name":"漫画改","count":507,"total_count":895810},{"name":"ArtLand","count":478,"total_count":3339},{"name":"蟲師","count":445,"total_count":2629},{"name":"内涵","count":409,"total_count":6910},{"name":"银古","count":342,"total_count":363},{"name":"2005年10月","count":220,"total_count":2123},{"name":"银古叔","count":215,"total_count":220},{"name":"漫改","count":179,"total_count":371151},{"name":"日本","count":141,"total_count":316616},{"name":"长滨博史","count":126,"total_count":1210},{"name":"行走","count":109,"total_count":112},{"name":"神作","count":93,"total_count":48420},{"